        <h2 id="bug-report">When reporting a bug, please include:</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>your Meta Quest device model;</li>
          <li>app version, if visible;</li>
          <li>what you were doing when the issue occurred;</li>
          <li>whether you were playing solo or online;</li>
          <li>whether you were hosting or joining a session;</li>
          <li>screenshots, video, or logs if available.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="common-topics">Common topics</h2>
        <h3>The game feels intense in VR</h3>
        <p>ACCRETION is a fast 6DOF VR space dogfighting game. If you feel discomfort, stop playing, remove the headset, and rest.</p>

        <h3>Multiplayer issues</h3>
        <p>If you experience connection problems, include your region, whether you were hosting or joining, and whether the issue happened before, during, or after a match.</p>

        <h3 id="privacy-requests">Privacy requests</h3>
        <p>For privacy-related requests, use the contact information on the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy page</a>.</p>

